{"type":"plan","title":"The Mended Kite","logline":"A gust tears a child's kite; a grandfather's sailor's seam and a gold star send it soaring again over Brighton's shore.","shots":[{"index":1,"shotType":"Wide shot","description":"Establishing wide view of Brighton pier and shingle beach at windy autumn morning, Maya stands on the pier holding the kite string, the red kite soaring high above the railings, sea breeze rippling the water.","mode":"motion","dialogue":"On a windy autumn morning in Brighton, eight-year-old Maya flies her red kite above the pier.","cites":[1,6]},{"index":2,"shotType":"Close-up","description":"Close-up on the kite as a sudden gust slams it into the pier railings, the red sail tears from corner to corner, a jagged hole appears with a flap hanging, sky visible through the tear.","mode":"motion","dialogue":"A gust slams it into the pier railings, and the red sail tears from corner to corner.","cites":[1,3,4]},{"index":3,"shotType":"Medium shot","description":"Medium shot along the seafront: Maya runs toward home, the broken kite hugged to her chest, shingle crunching under her wellies, morning wind still blowing.","mode":"motion","dialogue":"Maya runs home along the seafront, the broken kite hugged to her chest.","cites":[1]},{"index":4,"shotType":"Slow zoom-in","description":"Slow zoom-in inside the cozy kitchen at morning light: Grandfather sits at the wooden table, newspaper lowered, looking up toward the doorway as Maya enters.","mode":"still","dialogue":"Her grandfather, who mended sails when he was young, looks up from his newspaper.","cites":[2,5]},{"index":5,"shotType":"Close-up","description":"Close-up on the kitchen table: Grandfather's hands lay the kite flat, thread a needle with sailcloth thread, morning light glints on the needle.","mode":"motion","dialogue":"At the kitchen table he lays the kite flat and threads a needle with sailcloth thread.","cites":[2,5]},{"index":6,"shotType":"Medium shot","description":"Medium shot from over Grandfather's shoulder: he stitches a sailor's seam across the tear, Maya watches closely, the patch begins to form.","mode":"motion","dialogue":"Stitch by stitch, he shows Maya how a sailor's seam holds against the wind.","cites":[2,5]},{"index":7,"shotType":"Close-up","description":"Close-up on Maya's hand painting a small gold star over the white patch, the star glints in the morning light.","mode":"motion","dialogue":"Maya paints a small gold star over the patch, so the kite will remember.","cites":[2,5]},{"index":8,"shotType":"Wide shot","description":"Wide shot of Brighton beach in bright afternoon: Maya and Grandfather walk side by side along the sand, the mended kite tucked under Grandfather's arm, sea calm, golden light beginning.","mode":"motion","dialogue":"In the afternoon they walk back to the beach together, the kite under Grandfather's arm.","cites":[1]},{"index":9,"shotType":"Low angle","description":"Low angle looking up: Maya runs into the wind, the starred kite climbs higher than ever over the waves, string taut, Grandfather watches with a grin.","mode":"motion","dialogue":"Maya runs into the wind, and the kite climbs higher than ever over the waves.","cites":[1,6]},{"index":10,"shotType":"Medium shot","description":"Medium two-shot on the sand: Maya extends the kite string toward Grandfather, he takes it and laughs like a boy, the kite soaring above them.","mode":"motion","dialogue":"She hands the string to her grandfather, and he laughs like a boy.","cites":[1]},{"index":11,"shotType":"Wide shot","description":"Wide shot at golden dusk: Maya and Grandfather stroll home along the shingle beach, the mended starred kite resting on Maya's shoulder, the pier silhouetted against the glowing sky.","mode":"motion","dialogue":"At golden dusk they walk home along the sand, the mended kite on Maya's shoulder.","cites":[1]}]}
